        "text": "Summary\nUntil this chapter, you saw most of the activities you will have to execute as a\npenetration tester. In this chapter, you learned how to present your work as a\nprofessional to your clients or employers (remember that the report you show\nis your professional image). You\u2019ve seen how to evaluate your findings\u2019 scoring,\nand you learned the essential parts of a professional security report. In the rest\nof this book\u2019s chapters, you will learn more advanced topics to take your skills\nto the next level in penetration testing.",
